  "description": {
    "raw": "Your animal companion moves with astonishing agility and speed until the end of its turn. It can move at full speed while using Acrobatics, and it gains a competence bonus equal to twice your caster level (maximum +20 at 10th level) on Acrobatics checks to avoid attacks of opportunity or move through a square occupied by an enemy.",
    "search_text": "\"your animal companion moves with astonishing agility and speed until the end of its turn. it can move at full speed while using acrobatics, and it gains a competence bonus equal to twice your caster level (maximum +20 at 10th level) on acrobatics checks to avoid attacks of opportunity or move through a square occupied by an enemy.\"",
